Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery (@metals-and-metallurgical-production: 0, is #chapter, #metals-and-metallurgical-production "foundations/Reading-metals-and-metallurgy-from-zero.lingua#r_4CE7RHN6J3G88C6TSTHHCZDQ8V") { r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1
Understand how mineral and secondary feeds become specified metals/alloys, useful manufactured products, and further recoverable or residual materials. Begin with familiar objects, material language, quantities, observations, and product requirements. Deepen through extraction/refining, thermodynamics/transport, metal-family cases, structure/transformations, fabrication/treatment, testing, operation, and independent scholarship.

For individual process studies, enter [Roasting, reduction, and smelting](pyrometallurgy/Roasting-reactions-gas-potentials-and-solid-products.lingua#r_0NKV4BHR9Z7W2Y2H4Y1SDAH519) or [Electrode reactions and cell behavior](electrometallurgy/Electrode-kinetics-overpotential-and-mass-transfer.lingua#r_3SJ6Y5KK3T5J69KMTGSNE2P9VR). [Charge, efficiency, and accepted product](electrometallurgy/Faraday-account-current-efficiency-and-accepted-product.lingua#r_4YKAZ56DZSGM8JH2H033S1SMK5) connects the electrical account with the actual metal output. Each study links the relevant shared foundations and its next process steps.

Start with [Read from a familiar metal object through substantial theory, production, and independent scholarship](foundations/Reading-metals-and-metallurgy-from-zero.lingua#r_4CE7RHN6J3G88C6TSTHHCZDQ8V). [Complete substantial metallurgical books, university work, and connected process cases](research/A-sustained-metallurgical-theory-and-practice-programme.lingua#r_1SHGMZ8VHVSK4XT13EPK5P2EEJ) provides the substantial whole-book/course progression; [Metals and metallurgical production sources — books, courses, methods, and cases](Sources.lingua#r_03Z21BSG78ZRQSAVCCD6FJVNRY) identifies authorized editions, open licences, free copyrighted works, additional commercial books, and access/inspection limits. The later studies require derivations, independent calculations, competing mechanisms/designs, actual methods and observations, uncertainty, and a defended integrated system.

**Objects, feed, and quantities:** [Begin with a metal object, its useful behavior, and how that behavior was produced](foundations/A-metal-object-and-production-question.lingua#r_3HAAEK6MJJGDHPR5BNYP5KV596), [Use metallurgical vocabulary with a defined material, basis, and purpose](foundations/Metal-alloy-feed-phase-and-process-language.lingua#r_6CS9CNJZZGHDSPVNSBZH1E0V92), [Connect metallic behavior with bonding, structure, and the material actually present](foundations/Metallic-bonding-solutions-phases-and-properties.lingua#r_7RGGJ6PG474BP7MTDGTASEDKP7), [Characterize a metallurgical feed for its actual chemical and physical response](feedstocks/Feed-characterization-mineral-scrap-and-intermediate.lingua#r_2ZDRP5ZC01VAT3METZXTN739KY), [Translate a useful metal product into composition, structure, form, and test evidence](feedstocks/Usable-metal-product-specifications-and-evidence.lingua#r_1XE5CFK55A0FXE6NMYC52D07MC), [Close conserved-element and inventory accounts before judging metallurgical performance](balances/Conserved-elements-charge-inventory-and-recovery.lingua#r_1B1CBH4MSY63JZCHDPZHCJ095E), and [Choose a bounded three-feed charge with exact balances and a stated impurity limit](balances/An-inspectable-three-feed-charge.lingua#r_3WVFHB258A1DYT3PE8KX78EGD5).

**Models and process principles:** [Define activities and reference states before comparing metallurgical equilibria](thermodynamics/Metal-slag-solution-and-gas-activities.lingua#r_71JYY2MP09YGH0465M7EESKFPQ), [Read an alloy phase diagram with its basis, constraints, and processing question](thermodynamics/Alloy-phase-diagrams-constraints-and-actual-material-states.lingua#r_1PP21D2BEFX4GRAHT6RKQJE0B0), [Derive potential diagrams without confusing thermodynamic possibility with process performance](thermodynamics/Ellingham-predominance-and-reaction-potential-diagrams.lingua#r_5A36GMP668XNSSNDRF6XQ79GTC), [Join material and energy balances with actual phases, temperatures, and work](balances/Heat-work-reaction-enthalpy-and-furnace-accounts.lingua#r_685N41C1X9JPJKRZRMF2PYACFE), [Derive transport relations with their conserved quantity, mechanism, and boundary conditions](kinetics/Conservation-fluxes-gradients-and-interfacial-transfer.lingua#r_5N8Z97S1PHYZJXPCPN7E1NRMR1), [Verify a conservative diffusion calculation against an independent analytic solution](kinetics/An-inspectable-conservative-diffusion-calculation.lingua#r_2SMK31412VCY92Z6GTYZGYG9YM), [Connect reactor performance with mixing, residence histories, and phase interactions](kinetics/Reactors-mixing-residence-time-and-multiphase-scale-up.lingua#r_4AR0Y409MHHGFJ3CVYJR64JJ9G), [Compare furnaces through their material, thermal, chemical, and operating duties](pyrometallurgy/Furnaces-heating-duties-and-process-integration.lingua#r_52KDARYWHWG24BXQ0SX36QQYZY), [Connect slag chemistry with activities, phases, transport, and actual separation](pyrometallurgy/Slag-chemistry-activities-viscosity-and-physical-state.lingua#r_5K9C7AGZASB27TFJ1JT6NJYD8Q), [Derive refining performance from phase distribution and finite material inventories](refining/Distribution-ratios-stage-balances-and-impurity-fate.lingua#r_63HT1JN0JGBF5G17D2HSVAVRE5), [Explain leaching through mineral reactions, solution chemistry, and the whole feed](hydrometallurgy/Leaching-speciation-selectivity-and-complete-solution-accounts.lingua#r_2PXCEXY9HNAWMYA9HSZBF4JNH2), [Design an extraction argument from equilibrium, finite phases, and actual contact evidence](hydrometallurgy/Solvent-extraction-distribution-selectivity-and-staged-contact.lingua#r_6HYBSHN4W0NKJM2KXJASD5R1VE), [Connect electrowinning with solution preparation, competing reactions, and deposit quality](electrometallurgy/Electrowinning-solution-quality-deposit-and-anode-reaction.lingua#r_73FM9HEWKQQ9WZW89PVQH873Z9), and [Explain molten-salt production through coupled chemistry, current, heat, and material evidence](electrometallurgy/Molten-salt-extraction-chemistry-heat-and-containment.lingua#r_5J4EF5HRK4TAPTCT56SCND2SRY).

**Complete metal-family accounts:** [Compare ironmaking routes with the burden and final steel requirement explicit](metal-families/Iron-feeds-burden-reductants-and-route-selection.lingua#r_2XFN71HW1HPVHZWH0135TJERBG), [Reconstruct a blast furnace through coupled reduction, heat, flow, and material behavior](metal-families/Blast-furnace-reduction-heat-gas-flow-and-burden.lingua#r_4KZ0TXMQ2WAT83FCPAEVVTMEV6), [Evaluate direct and smelting reduction through product state and complete system duties](metal-families/Direct-and-smelting-reduction-intermediates-and-energy-systems.lingua#r_78WJKGTR6J2VBT9RMH770V263T), [Connect secondary steel treatment with measured chemistry, inclusions, and required performance](metal-families/Secondary-steelmaking-gases-inclusions-and-cleanliness.lingua#r_4KWHT49WZJGRRP09VB93RD52HA), [Explain why stainless steels, alloy steels, and cast irons need distinct processing evidence](metal-families/Stainless-alloy-steels-and-cast-iron-route-differences.lingua#r_24G8BGM2R0SY1EYFR56E5GF4X9), [Follow alumina production through mineral chemistry, circulating solution, and residue](metal-families/Bauxite-alumina-solution-circuits-and-residue.lingua#r_5GGD4Q68DT33WZQVNFZVY7MP36), [Reconstruct aluminium electrolysis as a coupled material, electrical, and thermal system](metal-families/Aluminium-electrolysis-anodes-bath-heat-and-product.lingua#r_03JS3JSTHRVNN500EZ8JQ11FG0), [Connect aluminium quality with alloy constitution, fabrication, and scrap history](metal-families/Aluminium-cast-wrought-and-recycled-product-pathways.lingua#r_4E4KG131W9P8N9AS7SS3JBTTNX), [Follow sulfide copper through matte, slag, gas, conversion, and refining feed](metal-families/Copper-sulfide-smelting-conversion-and-sulfur-systems.lingua#r_2GZT07FQCPW7HY4VB6CDWVWT3N), [Reconstruct copper solution routes with coupled feed, purification, and cell evidence](metal-families/Copper-leaching-extraction-electrowinning-and-returned-solutions.lingua#r_7V3XG6GE2VAV9D7BX786V5DA05), [Connect copper product quality with refining, gas chemistry, structure, and use](metal-families/Copper-purity-oxygen-alloys-conductors-and-fabrication.lingua#r_3SAWE0GBR52FS13AHT520Z5CH2), [Compare nickel and cobalt routes through feed chemistry and multimetal recovery](metal-families/Nickel-cobalt-and-multimetal-feed-separation.lingua#r_1GQF94K58HKQ23PKPYK2XT94CH), [Use zinc, lead, and tin to compare volatility, smelting, solution refining, and recovery](metal-families/Zinc-lead-tin-volatility-solution-routes-and-impurities.lingua#r_5PVAQSH9FNEZM9BP783GRKGQDR), [Connect reactive-metal production with compound preparation, reduction, and contamination evidence](metal-families/Titanium-magnesium-reactive-metals-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_5EDSESE8BJNK0ZJXE74BRF493P), [Follow specialty metals through chemical similarity, impurity control, and useful product form](metal-families/Refractory-minor-and-rare-earth-metals-as-separation-problems.lingua#r_64WFPWCN7JW7KG6Y4AN5EJ33CT), and [Study precious-metal recovery as a whole multimetal and residue system](metal-families/Precious-metals-complex-feeds-refining-and-residuals.lingua#r_3TR9TNQZ67YTDRZ1PYW6TGMCTX).

**Structure and manufacturing:** [Describe an alloy state through phases, defects, spatial structure, and processing history](structure/Alloy-states-history-and-structure-property-evidence.lingua#r_6DWZGNBM98KP22AK1XC1H55Q7C), [Connect crystal deformation mechanisms with measured material response](structure/Dislocations-slip-twinning-and-crystal-response.lingua#r_20235H2JPMBC98V0BGH00ZTMHM), [Compare strengthening mechanisms with the actual structural and performance evidence](structure/Solute-particle-grain-and-work-strengthening.lingua#r_6ZCH11YX10JBBKDSJDHM0YGGQW), [Compare steel transformation mechanisms through complete theory and primary observations](structure/Steel-transformations-pearlite-martensite-bainite-and-evidence.lingua#r_5JVE2AWASGR0Z8GRAR1JE65BBG), [Evaluate calculated alloy equilibria through model definitions, assessment evidence, and verification](structure/Assessed-thermodynamic-models-databases-and-phase-predictions.lingua#r_3E072MYE1DJKV48DPM4M1WR94T), [Derive solidification through interface conditions and coupled heat/solute transport](solidification/Nucleation-growth-heat-and-solute-at-an-interface.lingua#r_2QEBG1QH9VBZJY4ZF6ANQS5RRT), [Check equilibrium and Scheil limits with distinct instantaneous and mean-solid compositions](solidification/An-inspectable-equilibrium-and-Scheil-comparison.lingua#r_303TRCDBJ49TR1RA2H9B13CTDA), [Connect casting design with heat, flow, material quality, and independent defect evidence](solidification/Casting-molds-feeding-inclusions-gases-and-defects.lingua#r_1Q2NKXMA98SM3CYSAV1YZ5M82E), [Explain physical refining through phase distribution, transport, and contamination evidence](refining/Volatility-segregation-zone-refining-and-high-purity-handling.lingua#r_639221FWZC0ZJRD057G5VSFR84), [Derive metal-forming models with the actual stress, strain, rate, and material state](forming/Stress-strain-yield-flow-and-deformation-history.lingua#r_5Y6ANG20ZFEX2WTRJKCQR4EM4J), [Design a heat-treatment argument from actual material state and measured thermal history](heat-treatment/Thermal-routes-hardenability-tempering-and-state-control.lingua#r_676TY8604ZTWBXDDYMQ8637613), [Explain a joint through chemistry, heat, flow, transformations, and evidence across its regions](manufacturing/Joining-weld-metallurgy-heat-affected-zones-and-dissimilar-materials.lingua#r_4D14X4AKXB4YK072HE2FCYD68A), [Follow powder metallurgy from particles and surfaces to consolidated material](manufacturing/Powder-production-characterization-compaction-and-sintering.lingua#r_4BJPAMHBXM1S84THXZ6YFKDNH8), and [Connect metal additive processing with repeated thermal histories and qualified evidence](manufacturing/Metal-additive-processing-thermal-cycles-feed-and-defects.lingua#r_3JT2FNTBJ8P4PSX979PW0CZM73).

