ective-evidence-study.lingua#r_6GM4DMN4X8E248D3HPH49BM2JE), [Construct a coherent metal-production, use-quality, and recovery study across the whole chain](research/Integrated-feed-to-qualified-metal-product-and-recovery-study.lingua#r_23EJ948P4NHVC4SFAK06ERMSGF), [Investigate an unresolved metallurgical question with independent and challengeable evidence](research/Independent-metallurgical-scholarship-and-new-evidence.lingua#r_631TWRB9DJYJVCFP74GBBAYQ9S), and [Explain, calculate, investigate, and defend a complete metallurgical system](research/Completion-and-continuing-metallurgical-and-material-studies.lingua#r_0R83KVWADSY0WEENB0Q0E9A1N2).

Ordinary `#metals-and-metallurgical-production` links select useful next steps, including shared Records with distinct continuations. Source/reference links do not absorb neighboring subjects into this learning selection. Enter anywhere and follow an unfamiliar idea to its explanation. [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../../../stem/engineering/mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA), [Mineralogy and petrology — minerals, crystals, rock processes, and investigation](../../../nature/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN), [General chemistry](../../../stem/chemistry/general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5), and [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) provide reusable foundations. [Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery](../Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../../stem/engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Ergon](../../Ergon.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [STEM — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../../stem/STEM.lingua#r_4B137J3ZBVM7TD2NA797H2CZ7E), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), and [Philosophy](../../../philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001) connect the wider body of knowledge.

